## Formal ontology mappings

- **SIOC 2007** `sioc:next_by_date` — exact semantic match (the source standard)
- **SKOS OrderedCollection** — alternative shape; pairwise-cons-list strictly superior for append-only
- **rdf:List** — single-linked-list cons cells (close analogue but rdf:List requires reconstruction at emit)

